        },
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52180870?u=850e2c4322f391a0724f784137457c3599f77892&v=4",
                "login": "diego-velez",
                "resourcePath": "/diego-velez",
                "url": "https://github.com/diego-velez"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I got it working like this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n  local function simulate_keypress(key)\r\n    local termcodes = vim.api.nvim_replace_termcodes(key, true, false, true)\r\n    vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(termcodes, 'm', false)\r\n  end\r\n\r\n  vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('CompleteDone', {\r\n    callback = function()\r\n      if vim.v.event.complete_type == 'files' and vim.v.event.reason == 'accept' then\r\n        simulate_keypress '<c-x>'\r\n        simulate_keypress '<c-f>'\r\n      end\r\n    end,\r\n  })\r\n\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I got it working like this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"  local function simulate_keypress(key)\n    local termcodes = vim.api.nvim_replace_termcodes(key, true, false, true)\n    vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(termcodes, 'm', false)\n  end\n\n  vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('CompleteDone', {\n    callback = function()\n      if vim.v.event.complete_type == 'files' and vim.v.event.reason == 'accept' then\n        simulate_keypress '&lt;c-x&gt;'\n        simulate_keypress '&lt;c-f&gt;'\n      end\n    end,\n  })\n\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">  <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">simulate_keypress</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">key</span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">termcodes</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_replace_termcodes</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">key</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_feedkeys</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">termcodes</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>m<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>)\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>CompleteDone<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n    <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">v</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">event</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">complete_type</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>files<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">v</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">event</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">reason</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>accept<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">simulate_keypress</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;c-x&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">simulate_keypress</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;c-f&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n  })\n</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "I got it working like this:\n  local function simulate_keypress(key)\n    local termcodes = vim.api.nvim_replace_termcodes(key, true, false, true)\n    vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(termcodes, 'm', false)\n  end\n\n  vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('CompleteDone', {\n    callback = function()\n      if vim.v.event.complete_type == 'files' and vim.v.event.reason == 'accept' then\n        simulate_keypress '<c-x>'\n        simulate_keypress '<c-f>'\n      end\n    end,\n  })",
